{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And He spoke — in the wilderness of Sinai, on the first of the month, etc.</b> Out of His love for them He counts them at every moment — when they went out of Egypt He counted them, and when they fell at the calf He counted them, to know the number of those who remained; when He came to cause His Shechinah to rest upon them He counted them. On the first of Nisan the Tabernacle was erected, and on the first of Iyyar He counted them."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:07.747013077Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}